# The build context is the sample app. Nothing a developer might drop into it that is secret may
# reach the image: the seed is committed into a bare repo INSIDE the image and cloned into every
# sandbox, where customer code can read it. (Honoured by BuildKit only, which Docker uses by default.)
node_modules
dist
src/pages/*.tmp.tsx
.git
.env
.env.*
*.pem
*.key
